WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Everything your team is working on, in one fast list.

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:10.839
Create an issue in a few keystrokes.

00:00:10.939 --> 00:00:13.440
Every issue opens into a full page of details.

00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:19.643
Switch to a board to see the flow of work.

00:00:19.743 --> 00:00:23.976
Drag a card to move it along.

00:00:24.076 --> 00:00:35.342
Ask the Flow Agent about your work.

00:00:35.442 --> 00:00:37.955
Flow. Plan, build and ship together.
